    {
      "kind": "client",
      "evidence": "Global.Text 93277 'Ice Troll Scout!' (title), 116829 (card), objective 116830; icon 12615."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wiki",
      "evidence": "data/content/dungeons/ice_troll_scout.json: difficulty 2, zone 'Snowhill', enemies ['Ice Troll Scout', 'Ice Troll Scout']."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "Starter at [68.58, 73.93, 541.98]: BJX fork FabledRealms.lua:3993 (Npcs.json Id 33822, sg_troll_hut_02_snow.adr). (R) the fork's own placement, not a captured one. Region Snowhill, place Snowhill."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 83 ('Ice Troll Scout! (the live random encounter: an ice troll scout's hut in Snowhill)'): scene sh_random_encounter_01, entry, exit, 3 waves, 9 spawns ({'Yeti': 6, 'Ice Troll': 3})."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Every spot inside the scene is the fork's generated layout, not an original one. Zone number 1240 is the fork's; ours must be assigned and the scene sh_random_encounter_01 has not been loaded by our server yet (the eleven shipped battles all use sg_random_encounter_clearing). Triggers: at-start spawns are actors, later waves follow the one before (the fork's 1.5 s delay is dropped). Knockouts and score are the design's defaults; coins and XP are the shipped battles' values, not the fork's 30 coins / 140 stars."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wiki",
      "evidence": "The quest step and the wiki put 'Ice Troll Scout' in this fight; the fork's layout had 'yeti' there. (R) 'Ice Troll Scout' takes those spots (wiki over the fork's roster)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: this scene needs one native load, and the starter or door of `entry` is drawn by the entrances work, not by this file. Each kind's rank here decides its health and hit at the fight's tier."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) The guide's main goal is the one goal shown from the start and is done with the fork's last goal; the steps before it stay, as the triggers of its waves and boss."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Guide overlay by scripts/dungeon_fights.py from data/content/dungeons/ice_troll_scout.json."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) rc-0136 (2026-11-11): the Ice Troll Scout that fights wears model 100 troll_ice.adr, the body of the fork battle's Ice Trolls (BJX Battles.json Id 83; its Npcs.json 46053 'Ice Troll'); 4546 sg_troll_hut_02_snow.adr is the scout's hut with no skeleton, the starter's look (entrance ice_troll_scout)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wiki",
      "evidence": "rc-0137 prize wheel: fandom 'Ice Troll Scout!' (revision 30399) lists one prize wheel per combat job and a 4-coin slot; any other job spins the items every job's wheel holds. Medic: 'Urgent Care Medic Fatigues' is in no catalogue or record, left off."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) rc-0136 pacing: the waves' Ice Trolls are normal enemies (the fork battle's Npcs.json 46053 'Ice Troll' is a wave enemy, not a boss) and the Ice Troll Scout who leads them is tough; every wave at boss rank made the fight a group fight, out of reach of the solo player its level gate asks for."
    }
